↓

Customer Response

↓

Reward Usage

↓

Subsequent Relationship Signals

↓

Learning
```

A reward that is repeatedly ignored should not simply be issued again.

The system should learn that the reward may have low relevance.

---

# Re-engagement Learning

The system should evaluate:

* whether the customer returned;
* what caused the return;
* whether the return produced meaningful value;
* whether the customer remained engaged;
* whether the intervention caused irritation;
* whether the customer subsequently disengaged.

The objective is not merely:

> "Did they open the app?"

The more important question is:

> **"Did the intervention genuinely improve the relationship?"**

---

# Engagement Intelligence Agent

The Engagement Intelligence Agent coordinates the customer-facing engagement experience.

It may collaborate with:

* Recognition Agent;
* Commerce Agent;
* Pantry Agent;
* Household Agent;
* Delivery Agent;
* Walk Mode Agent;
* Community Agent;
* Customer Support Agent.

The Engagement Intelligence Agent must not independently override domain ownership.

It orchestrates appropriate assistance while respecting domain boundaries.

---

